DESCRIPTION:Moved a week early this month. The Spooky Speakeasy has Level 39 on the 28th, and we return to the last Wednesday in November.\n\nOur monthly meeting, on the last Wednesday of the month at 4:30 on Level 39.\n\nWe’re continuing with London Falling by Patrick Radden Keefe. Light bites and wine will be served.
